This product uses third-party speech models and runtimes:

- OpenAI Whisper model weights, used through faster-whisper / CTranslate2.
  See https://github.com/openai/whisper and the model cards on Hugging Face.
- faster-whisper (MIT), https://github.com/SYSTRAN/faster-whisper
- Optional mono speaker diarization via pyannote.audio and the gated Hugging
  Face pipelines pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1 and pyannote/segmentation-3.0.
  Users must accept those model agreements and set HF_TOKEN before first use.
  See https://github.com/pyannote/pyannote-audio and the linked model cards.

TranscriPy itself does not redistribute those model weights; they are downloaded
on first use under each project's own terms.
